  <item>
    <title>Vol.09 一步一坑，装修哪有不发疯的呀！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64f59fd980c9ec4c5f212246</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64f59fd980c9ec4c5f212246</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 04 Sep 2023 09:14:01 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>装修装修，令人发疯！不更新的日子里，我们被装修折磨得心态大崩！从硬装全流程聊到如何网购家具不翻车，如果你即将装修，希望我们吃过的亏、踩过的坑、遇到的雷，能让你少走一丢丢弯路！</span></p><p></p><p><strong><span>【你会听到】</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="192">03:12</a> 自装的我，在闲鱼组装了一个施工队</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="372">06:12</a> 装修刚开始：就这样吧，凑合凑合得了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="585">09:45</a> 为什么不同的师傅喜欢互相diss？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="716">11:56</a> 瓷砖大翻车，对不齐的缝逼死强迫症</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="956">15:56</a> 急：美缝师傅弄坏了我的东西并且藏起来了怎么办！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1366">22:46</a> 半包公司的师傅，问我有没有他家老板的电话……！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1524">25:24</a> 别共情师傅了，不如先可怜可怜自己</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1874">31:14</a> 什么？！厨房台面怎么是两个颜色？！ &nbsp;</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2260">37:40</a> 彩色乳胶漆，慎选！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2439">40:39</a> 可恶！网购家具大翻车，客服永远眼神不好</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2780">46:20</a> 开荒保洁：有些钱还是让别人赚吧&nbsp;</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2910">48:30</a> ⚠️定制安装，一定要盯！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3000">50:00</a> 祝大家装修不踩坑！</span></p><p></p><p><span>本期BGM：Square Hammer——Ghost B.C.</span></p><p></p>]]></description>
