    <pubDate>Mon, 10 Jul 2023 08:21:30 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Hi~这里是新一期的「诸事皆宜」！这期我们跳脱现实，来一场漫无边际的白日梦，什么一夜暴富、重生之我是董事长、重生之回到xxxx、不设限之我是地球online付费玩家，谁还没有做过这些不切实际的梦呢！Anyway，口嗨一时爽，一直口嗨一直爽！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【你会听到】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="135">02:15</a> 如果我是董事长，我先把保安给开了&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="246">04:06</a> 如果一夜暴富，那我……先交税</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="319">05:19</a> 请赐予我无穷无尽的财富，欢乐豆也行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="503">08:23</a> 重生之我是已逝亿万富翁唯一财产继承猫</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="712">11:52</a> 重生之……我不愿意重生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="821">13:41</a> 重生之回到大学再玩四年唱、跳、rap&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="925">15:25</a> 不设限工作之我是地球online付费玩家&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1011">16:51</a> 佛系玩家上线，我就想在大兴机场开扫地车车</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1290">21:30</a> 开放题：如果xxx，那就好了 &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎在评论区留言讨论本期话题，祝你梦想成真万事Okay～</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾曲：河流 — 蛙池</span></p>]]></description>
