  <item>
    <title>Vol.06 有时候让情绪做自己的主人也挺爽的</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64995539d6cdb59728643492</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64995539d6cdb59728643492</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 26 Jun 2023 09:07:05 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Hi~这里是新一期的「诸事皆宜」！这期主打一个发疯stop，谁还没情绪上头过呢，那些令人血压飙升的时刻，到底怎么平复啊？我们这儿有自己使劲内耗的、有逃避的、有一定要发泄出来的、有无所谓的，你们会怎么处理呢？欢迎在评论区留言互动～</span></p><span></span><h2><span>【你会听到】</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="66">01:06</a> 情绪都到了，不哭一顿不太好吧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="156">02:36</a> 我的疯批属性在小时候就略见一二</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="344">05:44</a> 咋处理？逃避一下咯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="446">07:26</a> &nbsp;才不要做情绪垃圾桶</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="630">10:30</a> &nbsp;家人们谁懂啊，羞耻症犯了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="805">13:25</a> &nbsp;我好生气啊！你先别生气</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="923">15:23</a> 能内耗就先内耗吧，直接发疯不太行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1060">17:40</a> 情绪上头？先去卫生间冷静一下</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎在评论区留言讨论，祝你万事Okay情绪稳定～</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾曲：另一个自己 — 大粉乐队</span></p>]]></description>
